## Outcome and conditions

Apply the paper’s seven economic principles to a supplied policy counterfactual with explicit units, timing and evidence limits. Required components: complete_accounting_and_discount_units, uncertainty_distribution_and_public_goods, jurisdiction_cooperation_and_evidence_limits. Supported work may use the cited notes; independent checks use no notes, internet, solution or hints. A basic calculator and blank paper are allowed; reasoning, formula selection and assumptions must be supplied by the learner. Numerical examples below are agent-created hypothetical instantiations unless explicitly labelled as a finished-note example. They do not assert current market or policy facts.

