O012-S1 / item_version 1, supported_completion. **Prompt:** Hypothetical policy removes a programme saving 12 in real resource costs but losing 28 in comparably timed social benefits. A separate benefitB=120 arrives in8 years with early costs; compare its PV at3% and6%. Another declared energy case has0.5 tonCO2/MWh, SCC 80 USD/ton and local-air damage0.16 cents/kWh; compute climate and combined damage with units. A local pollutant varies sharply between neighbourhoods. Apply all seven finished-note principles: market failure, complete accounting, discounting, uncertainty, distribution, jurisdiction and international cooperation. Distinguish public research/information returns, cumulative exposure and regulatory counts from welfare; preserve current/historical, proposal/completed, production/lifecycle and legal/physical-loss boundaries and the paper’s method limits.

